From 8a98327ec6bca24283a17228adbaad2c167f9595 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jatniel <noreply@example.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 11:25:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] Add local player profiles (model only, iOS startup)

profile.rs keeps an index (profiles.json) of extra profiles, each with its
own game folder under profiles/profile-N. The built-in `default` profile is
the game folder itself, so a device without profiles.json starts exactly as
before and nothing is moved. On iOS, main.rs enters the active profile's
folder after the existing set_current_dir(home); logs stay in the game folder.

No UI yet: the profile picker is the next PR.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
