From 7835afe5fc894a8ae05e8ad108abba85d86deb61 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jatniel <noreply@example.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 17:14:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] Switch profiles from the startup menu without restarting

Choosing a profile in the startup menu now moves the running game into it:
the profile being left keeps its changed options, the working directory
becomes the new profile's folder, options.txt is read again (language, GUI
scale, window), the title's saves and last server follow, and the resource
loader restarts with the new profile's packs. Past the startup menu the
choice is still kept for the next launch.

