From: Jatniel <noreply@example.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 17:20:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] winit iOS: expose the view's safe area insets

WindowExtIOS::safe_area_insets returns safeAreaInsets of the window's view in
physical pixels (notch, rounded corners, status bar, home indicator), so the
game can keep touch controls clear of them. Nothing uses it yet.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
